# Production build env vars.
#
# These two are PUBLIC by design — they're inlined into the client JS bundle
# at `next build` time so the browser-side Supabase client knows where to
# connect. Row-Level Security in the database enforces tenancy, so a leaked
# anon/publishable key cannot read or write another firm's data.
#
# These also live in wrangler.jsonc `vars` so they're available at Worker
# runtime (for proxy.ts / server.ts on the edge). Both copies must match.
#
# DO NOT put SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY here — it must stay a wrangler secret.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://camphmqvrzqpgrhdjafo.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_wiFj4325ez0dD6O7ZYN6GA_igE_c9ov
